.venv/

# Capture payloads: raw sample data and Logic 2 session files. A rail sweep is
# ~12.5 MB per step, so these do not belong in the repo. The decoded CSVs beside
# them are kept - they are the evidence behind the findings in
# docs/bench-results.md, and they are kilobytes.
captures/**/*.bin
captures/**/*.sal

# Instrument calibration is committed deliberately, not ignored: it is specific
# to Logic Pro 8 id 5701262AE78884C9 and the results depend on it.
